-- Which falls stand inside the Blue Ridge physiographic province.
--
-- Computed once by point-in-polygon against the USGS Fenneman boundary in
-- static/blue-ridge.geojson, rather than recomputed per request: the polygon
-- does not move and 857 point-in-polygon tests per page view would be absurd.
--
-- 857 of 900 located features fall inside it. That the answer is nearly
-- everything is the point -- it is why a page of "Blue Ridge waterfalls" and a
-- page of "WNC waterfalls" cannot be two lists of the same falls, and have to
-- differ in how they are organised instead.

